This directory vendors the following files from onnxruntime-web v1.30.0
(https://www.npmjs.com/package/onnxruntime-web), redistributed here unmodified
so that demo/index.html can run offline:

    ort.min.js
    ort-wasm-simd-threaded.mjs
    ort-wasm-simd-threaded.wasm
    ort-wasm-simd-threaded.jsep.mjs
    ort-wasm-simd-threaded.jsep.wasm

